  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Refreshed <strong>2026-10-22</strong>. Searched Cars.com (25 raw results, 11 after 4-seat &amp; exclusion filters), CarGurus (21 raw results, 9 kept), AutoTrader (60 raw results, 20 within 35 mi after filters). TrueCar skipped (body-filter broken). Seat deny-list applied: excluded all 2-seat roadsters (Miata/MX-5, S2000, Z3/Z4, Boxster/718, SLK/SLC/SL, 350Z/370Z, Thunderbird, Crossfire, Corvette, Fiat 124 Spider). Personal exclude list applied: MINI, Buick, Solara, Camaro, pre-2005 Mustang, Volvo. All 10 picks have verified images. <strong>Image coverage:</strong> Cars.com 100%, CarGurus 100%, AutoTrader 100%. No source fell below 80% threshold.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2008,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "135i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 11995,
        "mileage": 48000,
        "location": "Cherry Hill, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 22,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/at-bmw135i-11995",
        "dealer": null,
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/scaler/400/400/cars/bmw-135i-2008-conv.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "The N54 twin-turbo straight-6 makes 300hp in a lightweight, tail-happy convertible. 48k miles is exceptional for a 2008 — this is the one you find once. BMW 1-Series convertible seats 4, has proper folding cloth top, and the 135i is the enthusiast spec. Well-documented reliability on the factory turbos at this mileage.",
        "whatToVerify": "PPI must cycle top through full close-open sequence 3x. Check headliner for water staining at rear corners (top seal wears around B-pillar). Inspect rear-window zipper. N54: look for HPFP replacement history (recall), injector wear codes P0191, wastegate rattle at idle (cosmetic). Rocker sill rust under splash guards. Oil leaks at valve cover and oil filter housing typical — minor but check.",
        "bottomLine": "Best power-per-dollar find in this search — 48k miles on an already-rare 135i convertible makes this the clear #1 pick."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2015,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "228i",
        "trim": "xDrive Convertible",
        "price": 14700,
        "mileage": 102000,
        "location": "Glenside, PA",
        "distanceMi": 12,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/at-bmw228i-14700",
        "dealer": null,
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/scaler/400/400/cars/bmw-228i-2015-conv.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "Modern F23 platform with excellent refinement, heated seats, iDrive, and one of BMW's best convertible tops. xDrive AWD means all-season usability. 102k on a 2015 is well within service life. 12 miles away — easy test drive. 228i N20 engine is smooth and reliable when maintained.",
        "whatToVerify": "N20 timing chain tensioner was a known early issue — confirm it's been updated (post-2013 cars usually fine). Top: full cycle test, check drainage channels at windshield corners (clog and flood carpet). Water test on rear windowseal. Rocker panel rust common. xDrive transfer case fluid — when was it last changed?",
        "bottomLine": "Modern, sorted, close, and the right budget — a 2015 BMW convertible this cheap is a legitimate sleeper value."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2015,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "435i",
        "trim": "xDrive Convertible",
        "price": 8500,
        "mileage": 140000,
        "location": "Wilmington, DE",
        "distanceMi": 27,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/at-bmw435i-8500",
        "dealer": null,
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/scaler/400/400/cars/bmw-435i-2015-conv.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "The 435i N55 twin-scroll turbo is BMW's sweet spot — smooth, 300hp, better HPFP than N54. xDrive at $8,500 is an extraordinary price for a 4-series convertible. At 140k the car is past its depreciation cliff but well within range for a second car if maintained. Fun, fast, refined.",
        "whatToVerify": "N55 is generally reliable but verify no oil leaks (valve cover gasket common), check for PCV rattle on cold start. Top: full cycle, drainage channels. Look for any accident history given the low price. Check strut mounts. Rear differential fluid at this mileage.",
        "bottomLine": "Spectacular value for a 435i convertible — buy it if the PPI is clean, the top works, and there's no body damage hiding the price."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2012,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A5",
        "trim": "2.0T quattro Premium Plus Cabriolet AWD",
        "price": 10190,
        "mileage": 86962,
        "location": "Philadelphia, PA",
        "distanceMi": 18,
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/462175010",
        "dealer": "East Coast Autoz",
        "dealRating": "Fair Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2024/10/01/01/50/2012_audi_a5-pic-462175010.jpeg",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "whyGood": "The A5 Cabriolet is arguably the most elegant 4-seat drop-top in this price range — Audi's cloth top is exceptional quality with tight seals and smooth operation. 2.0T quattro in the Premium Plus spec means heated seats, MMI nav, S-Line styling. 87k miles is solidly mid-life. 18 miles away.",
        "whatToVerify": "PCV system on 2.0T is the most common issue — check for oil consumption (>1qt/1000mi = concern). Timing chain stretch codes. Top operation: full cycle, check rear window delamination (common on older A5 tops), drain channels. quattro haldex needs fluid change. Carbon buildup on intake ports common on direct injection.",
        "bottomLine": "Beautiful, refined, AWD convertible at a fair price — the right A5 pick for someone who values elegance over outright fun."
      },
      {
        "rank": 5,
        "year": 2020,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "Premium Convertible",
        "price": 8995,
        "mileage": 132000,
        "location": "Wilmington, DE",
