        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/in/v2/p2p/audi-a3-2016-cabriolet",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "whyGood": "The A3 Cabriolet is a shrunken A5 — same great fabric top, same tight Audi interior, but lighter and more fun in city traffic. 2016 with 72k is well-maintained territory. S-tronic or Tiptronic in the A3 is very reliable at these miles. Clean title verified on Cars.com.",
        "whatToVerify": "2.0T EA888: verify PCV system for oil leaks (there was an updated PCV for this generation). Carbon buildup check. Top cycle, drain channels. DSG: any shudder at low speed? Subframe/strut mounts at 72k. Rear window check for delamination.",
        "bottomLine": "A 2016 A3 convertible with 72k is a well-aged city car that still has lots of life — practical, refined, and the right size for a fun second drop-top."
      },
      {
