        "whatToVerify": "Confirm engine: EcoBoost 2.3T or V6 — both fine but ask. 2.3T: check for spark plug thread saver inserts (early blowout issue, addressed by Ford). Coolant leaks. Top full cycle and rear window. 8.8 rear axle clunk on takeoff. MT-82 if manual. Rear camera function. Water in trunk from top seal failure.",
